{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act52side_level_act52side_06_end","storyGroup":"act52side","storySort":14,"storyDependence":"act52side_level_act52side_06_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"YW-6","storyName":"大人物","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"瓦列里奥在海图系统中抹去了港都的坐标。审判庭抓捕奥卢斯失败，而后奥卢斯出现在打捞中心，港都中心城区消失。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act52side/level_act52side_06_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act52side_06_end","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":12,"next":14,"characters":["紧张的岛民","虚弱的岛民","惩戒军士兵","惩戒军士官","特菲","瓦列里奥","斐戴拉","城镇居民B","城镇居民A","艾丽妮","？？？","岛民","奥卢斯"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_bg_74_g4_seasidest_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2272_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2273_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"1.6","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的岛民","text":"情况如何？","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2272_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虚弱的岛民","text":"伊比利亚人都聚集在广场。我们的伤员还是很多，没办法组织行动……","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的岛民","text":"导师会帮助我们。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2272_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虚弱的岛民","text":"奥卢斯先生还在工坊里？","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的岛民","text":"嗯。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2272_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虚弱的岛民","text":"真不知道他到底要怎么实行接下来的计划……","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","channel":"1","volume":"0.4","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":26},{"type":"multiline","name":"紧张的岛民","text":"等等，有脚步声——","id":27},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","channel":"2","volume":"1","id":28},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":29},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":30},{"type":"multiline","name":"紧张的岛民","text":"呃……","id":31},{"type":"multiline","id":32},{"type":"dialog","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"shake","power":"3","times":"30","duration":"0.3","id":34},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-150","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":36},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":37},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-150","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":39},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":41},{"type":"charslot","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2277_1#1$1","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.8","id":45},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士兵","text":"街区清扫完毕，长官，刚刚岛民所说的奥卢斯就是……","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2276_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"我们要找的深海主教。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"推进，包围那座工坊！","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":52},{"type":"dialog","id":53},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":54},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":55},{"type":"charslot","id":56},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_bg_27_g25_goldenboat_core.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":57},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":58},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":59},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":60},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":61,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#1$1","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"这个点就是港都，对吧？你的故乡。只不过它现在还暗着。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#5$1","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"每一个灰暗的坐标点，都是一座沉眠大海的城镇。伊比利亚到底失去了多少……清晰可见。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#5$1","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"我没经历过那个时代，其实想象不到你有多么怀念这里。但一想到我们马上就能亲手把它捞起来——我就忍不住浑身发抖。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#1$1","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"说实话，你是不是就是为了这一刻，才特意让我进船厂工作的呀？","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#4$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"……","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#4$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"想家就直说嘛，你作为我的头号拥护者，一路上又帮我解了许多围，我肯定会帮你的啊！","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#12$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"你已经帮我很多了，德·托莱多大人。这件事，确实是我没法单凭自己做到的。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#13$1","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"这几十年来，伊比利亚发生了太多变化。曾存在过的事物有一半已经被遗忘，而另一半不是变了模样，就是换了名字。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"如果不是有雅隆这样名字和位置都不曾变过的地标作为参照，我们甚至没法把现在和过去的地图以任何方式对应起来。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"要恢复海图系统的功能，需要操作者熟悉伊比利亚的每一寸土地，厘清错乱的地理信息，把过去与现在的每个坐标一一对应。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#1$1","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"我能做到的，你看，我已经在做了！","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#12$1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"从我在家乡的小镇第一次对证裁官撒谎，到今天已经十年了。为了混口饭吃、有个地方住，我当了十年的骗子。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#1$1","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"其实有好几次我都能感觉到，对方很清楚我只是一个图谋不轨的小人，但他们仍愿意继续“相信”我。","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#2$1","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"他们会配合我演“德·托莱多”的戏，也会给我讲很多他们的故事——他们那已经沉入大海的故乡，已经尸骨无存的亲人。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#2$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"我其实一直都没想明白，他们为什么愿意相信我。我只能把骗到的东西多分给他们一些，偶尔也用不光彩的手段替他们解决些小问题。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#8$1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"但来到港都之后……相信我的人越来越多，我能为他们每个人做的，却越来越少了。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#8$1","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"所以，那天你跟我说，我该成为一个真正的“大人物”时，我只恨你说得太晚。必须要这样，我才能为一些迷茫的人做到更多。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#4$1","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"不算晚，德·托莱多大人。只要你有足够的毅力和勇气去承担这个责任。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#14$1","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"责任？","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#9$1","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"我告诉过你，我身上烧伤的瘢痕，是为了帮一个朋友才留下的。","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#2$1","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"嗯，看上去很疼，你到现在还是整宿睡不着觉。","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#10$1","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"我帮那位朋友变成了你口中的“大人物”，但很可惜，他毁了我们共同的心血，没有把事情做好。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#14$1","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"因为他没有承担责任？","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#11$1","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"因为他不敢善始善终。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"你呢，德·托莱多大人？","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#5$1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"喂，你还不了解我嘛！","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"就是因为我太了解你了。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#15$1","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"欸？","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_bat_act17side_02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act17side/m_bat_act17side_02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":119,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"你是个骗子，而谎言总是有始无终的。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#4$1","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"当然，你也是个很有天赋的人，记忆力好得出奇，对伊比利亚的了解也无人能及。多亏了你，海图系统的功能已经完全恢复。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#4$1","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"你开了个好头，而我可以替你善终——","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#10$1","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"将雷亚-伊比利亚的坐标彻底从历史中抹去。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#14$1","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"我听不懂……瓦列里奥，为什么？如果是我弄错了，我们可以求斐戴拉大审判官想想办法，你不是说她很快就会来——","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#11$1","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"斐戴拉不会来了。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":132},{"type":"charslot","id":133},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_keyboard_console","volume":"0.5","channel":"f","loop":"true","id":134},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":135},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"1","id":136},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_keyboard_confirm","volume":"1","id":137},{"type":"text","text":"男人在特菲启动的海图系统界面上输入了一串密令。特菲心里涌现出一种不祥的预感，她想去阻止他，却已经来不及。","id":138},{"type":"text","text":"男人将手指移到雷亚-伊比利亚灰色的坐标点上，按了下去。","id":139},{"type":"dialog","id":140},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":141},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":142},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":143},{"type":"charslot","id":144},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_bg_74_g8_shipatelier.png","xScale":"1.15","yScale":"1.15","x":"-50","screenadapt":"coverall","id":145},{"type":"backgroundtween","image":"74_g8_shipatelier","xFrom":"-50","xTo":"-50","block":"false","id":146},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":147},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"你还是在用自己的遭遇替她求情。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"不，我想说的是，那孩子帮了很多人，但她终归是个孩子，是个骗子。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"伊比利亚的职责落到一个欺诈之徒的身上，证明了这个国家的堕落。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"……","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"单是用“堕落”来描述伊比利亚，就足够把你关入牢狱。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"但几天前还被我的说辞打动的大审判官，如今也觉得这样的故事不够动人了，不是吗？","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"几乎每个夜晚，船厂里都见不到您的身影，与此同时，那些带有危险气息的岛民正在悄无声息地消失……","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"您很喜欢扮演两重截然不同的身份？","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"20","randomness":"70","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"住口！","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":167},{"type":"charslot","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":169},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bldwhoosh","volume":"1","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"R","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,100","posto":"-250,0","duration":"0.5","id":171},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"20","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":172},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":173},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":174},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":176},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"3","ystrength":"3","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":177},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement_heavy2","volume":"1","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"L","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-250,50","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.4","id":179},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":180},{"type":"backgroundtween","image":"74_g8_shipatelier","duration":"0.4","xFrom":"-50","xTo":"50","block":"false","id":181},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":182},{"type":"charslot","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","posfrom":"120,20","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.4","id":184},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"看来继续说下去，您就不会给我开口的机会了。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"正因为你现在还能开口，所以我才会给予你一点尊重——你躲过了一名大审判官的剑，诡辩者。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"你是谁？你来找我的目的究竟是什么？如果我卸掉你的一只胳膊，流出的会是人的血，还是恐鱼令人作呕的黏液？","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#10$1","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"注意你的言辞，年轻人。","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#2$1","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"况且，整座船厂中唯一会令你作呕的东西，就在几天前刚刚被送到你的手里。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"你说什么……","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#4$1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"你不知道？","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"哈哈哈，卡门对他的学生真是太体贴了。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"那我想你也不知道，那把重启雷亚-伊比利亚的“钥匙”，让我们脚下的土地重回黄金时代的“希望”，是用审判庭过去的一切换来的。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"不！圣徒阁下不会向我隐瞒如此重要的事。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"是他蓄意隐瞒，还是你刻意不去听呢？","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"我怎么可能刻意……难道圣徒阁下召我去审判庭临时中枢的那天，是想告诉我这一切……","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"而那时你又在哪里？","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"我……","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#10$1","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"你早就做出了选择。你害怕城区里欣欣向荣的景象，因为你知道伊比利亚的沉疴跟你身上的伤口一样，它们不会轻易在海风中愈合。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"那些乐观的说辞不过是在欺骗你自己罢了。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"而更可悲的是，当你打开那个铁匣子，直面审判庭过去的一切时，你会发现你无法接受它所承载的事实。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#13$1","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"你不是一名合格的大审判官，斐戴拉。看看你的提灯，火苗在晃动。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"！","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"疲惫不堪了对吗？面对岛民和伊比利亚民众之间的矛盾，面对杀不完的恐鱼，面对希冀未来又对现状作呕的自己。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"你不让你手下的惩戒军审问岛民和教徒，是不想让他们沾染和你一样的恶习，不想让他们也对审判庭动摇，不是吗？","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"但若是伊比利亚不给人无谓的希望，你本不用承受这些。你早已习惯忍受伤口的疼痛，但不擅长祈祷它痊愈。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"……","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"你到底是谁，为什么会知道那么多关于我的、关于审判庭的事？！","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#2$1","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"直到这一刻你还在乎审判庭的安危，我简直像是见到了过去的自己……不过他已经死了。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"死了？","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":229},{"type":"charslot","id":230},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.8","id":231},{"type":"text","text":"斐戴拉还想追问，但下一秒她看到了瓦列里奥斗篷下的瘢痕，从背部蔓延到脸颊。","id":232},{"type":"dialog","id":233},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":234},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":235},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":236},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":237},{"type":"charslot","id":238},{"type":"focusparam","effect":"Grayscale","blur":"false","id":239},{"type":"bg","duration":"0.1","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":240},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_bg_74_g8_shipatelier.png","xScale":"1.3","yScale":"1.3","screenadapt":"coverall","id":241},{"type":"backgroundtween","image":"74_g8_shipatelier","duration":"8","xFrom":"-50","xTo":"30","yFrom":"180","yTo":"180","ease":"6","block":"false","id":242},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.3","fillto":"0.32","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.1","id":243},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.3","fillto":"0.22","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#4$2","isblock":"false","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.2","duration":"0","isblock":"false","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-80,280","posto":"0,280","duration":"8","isblock":"false","id":247},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":248},{"type":"text","text":"而他的腰间有一把斐戴拉再熟悉不过的武器——审判庭的手炮，带着独属于圣徒的刻痕。","id":249},{"type":"text","text":"斐戴拉刚成为卡门的学生不久，就听闻有两位圣徒在大火中与海嗣厮杀至最后一刻，尸骨无存。卡门说，他们是为伊比利亚的未来而死。","id":250},{"type":"text","text":"为达里奥送行时，她曾在坟前默念那两个伟大的名字，而更擅长使用手炮的那位圣徒正是——","id":251},{"type":"dialog","id":252},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":253},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":254},{"type":"curtain","id":255},{"type":"background","id":256},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_bg_74_g8_shipatelier.png","xScale":"1.15","yScale":"1.15","screenadapt":"coverall","id":257},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":258},{"type":"focusparam","blur":"false","id":259},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":260},{"type":"charslot","id":261},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":262},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":263},{"type":"charslot","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"圣徒瓦列里奥……这怎么可能……","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$2","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"我也想死在那场大火中，死在石碑的铭文里，但我需要纠正伊比利亚的错误。","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$2","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"而你知道那个错误是什么。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"我们的土地上仍遍布着恶行……哪怕是审判庭内部也并非洁净的圣所。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"圣徒瓦列里奥，我想要消除它们，在太阳重新升起的明天，我希望它照亮的……是一个纯净的伊比利亚，一个令人骄傲的国家。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"所以我用尽一切力气，独自进行审判，想让我手下的士兵远离战争的阴霾，逃脱仇恨的循环。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"在阿奎拉死后，我又去翻阅了审判庭的档案——每一次审问或者处决岛民和深海教徒之后，我都会这样做。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"我怕自己做了错误的决定，违背了圣徒教导的美德，但是……","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"四次。在我担任大审判官的二十年中，在几万名嫌疑人中，我清楚地记得，我犯过四次错误。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"我无法坦坦荡荡地迎接伊比利亚的明天，它的光不会照耀到我身上……","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$2","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"你做得足够好了，大审判官，一切的根源是伊比利亚的黎明本就不该这么早到来。","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"……","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"您有自己的计划。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$2","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"我说过，我是来纠正错误的。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"大审判官，你的灯火快熄灭了。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"我能将它再度点亮，以一名死而复生的圣徒的信念。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"……您需要我做什么？","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$2","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"在打捞庆典的那个夜晚，离开这里。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":294},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":295},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":296},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"false","id":297},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","fadetime":"3","keep":"true","block":"false","id":298},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_bg_32_RL2_cliffnight.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"3","block":"false","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":300},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sea","volume":"0","channel":"f","loop":"true","id":301},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":302},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"f","fadetime":"1","id":303},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"……","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":307},{"type":"charslot","id":308},{"type":"backgroundtween","image":"32_RL2_cliffnight","duration":"15","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.15","yScaleTo":"1.15","yFrom":"0","yTo":"-40","xFrom":"0","xTo":"15","block":"false","id":309},{"type":"text","text":"人们庆贺的声响从远处的广场传来，训练有素的惩戒军披着夜色净化罪孽。","id":310},{"type":"text","text":"船工们在码头忙碌，他们不敢完全踏入漆黑的大海，但眼里闪烁着好奇的光彩。","id":311},{"type":"text","text":"斐戴拉看向手中的提灯，海风中的灯火沾染血色，它是整片海岸上除月光之外的唯一光源。","id":312},{"type":"text","text":"它微弱地挣扎，它几近熄灭。","id":313},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":314},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":315},{"type":"dialog","id":316},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":317},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":318},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_bg_74_g4_seasidest_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":319},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":320},{"type":"charslot","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":323},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act17side/m_sys_act17side_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":324,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2274_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_178","focus":"r","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民B","text":"是我喝多了吗？那些审判官和惩戒军怎么突然跑起来了？","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民A","text":"是打捞时间提前了？别挤，让我也看一眼——","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":330},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"20,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.3","id":331},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":332},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民B","text":"海图上……坐标，消失了……","id":334},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民A","text":"什么？","id":336},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民B","text":"海图！代表港都的那个坐标，没了，看不见了！","id":338},{"type":"dialog","id":339},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":340},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":341},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.18","fillto":"0.18","fadetime":"0.1","id":342},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.18","fillto":"0.18","fadetime":"0.1","id":343},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_bg_38_g21_skystarry_L2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":344},{"type":"backgroundtween","image":"70_g2_tjlibrary","duration":"15","xScaleFrom":"1.15","yScaleFrom":"1.15","xScaleTo":"1.15","yScaleTo":"1.15","xFrom":"-50","xTo":"50","block":"false","id":345},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":346},{"type":"charslot","id":347},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":348},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":349},{"type":"text","text":"黄金的海图仍旧投映在广场上空，但其中，有一个不起眼的灰暗的光点悄然消失了。","id":350},{"type":"text","text":"与它一同消失的，是港都几十座灯塔的辉光。","id":351},{"type":"text","text":"越来越多的人抬起头，他们徒劳地寻找着坐标，寻找着那个让他们欢聚在广场上庆贺的理由，却一无所获。","id":352},{"type":"text","text":"那张海图对伊比利亚人失去了意义，似乎雷亚-伊比利亚永远不会再亮起，永远不会再……回来。","id":353},{"type":"dialog","id":354},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":355},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":356},{"type":"charslot","id":357},{"type":"curtain","id":358},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_bg_27_g25_goldenboat_core.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":359},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":360},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":361},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":362},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":363},{"type":"playsound","key":"$alarmenter","volume":"0.8","id":364},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0.2","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":365},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":366},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":367},{"type":"playsound","key":"$alarmenter","volume":"0.8","id":368},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0.15","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":369},{"type":"delay","time":"0.6","id":370},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":372},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"你抹去了雷亚-伊比利亚的坐标？为什么……瓦列里奥你为什么这么做！","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"你还没有明白。于你，于我，进入中控室从来都是计划的一部分，最重要的那部分。","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"你……骗了我？","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"现在，你也算是成了一个“大人物”了……只不过不是点亮海图的那个。","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"你！","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"我们的旅途到此结束了，特菲。","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#13$1","focus":"l","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"惩戒军应该很快就会封锁这里，我还要去见一位很重要的朋友。","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"开心点，或者唱支歌。","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"至少，你没有让我这个“拥护者”失望，不是吗？","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":391},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":392},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":393},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":394},{"type":"charslot","id":395},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_bg_74_g4_seasidest_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":396},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":397},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2277_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":399},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"北向侧门？南向两个地下室出入口？","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士兵","text":"都已经封锁！","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2276_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"好。行动！","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":406},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":407},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":408},{"type":"charslot","id":409},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_bg_74_g7_alsatelier.png","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","id":410},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":411},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":412},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":413},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"20","randomness":"70","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":414},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_doorbreak","volume":"0.8","id":415},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":416},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2277_1#1$1","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"……没有人？","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":419},{"type":"charslot","id":420},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_seaborn_wiggle","volume":"1","id":421},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1389_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1388_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":423},{"type":"delay","time":"1.8","id":424},{"type":"dialog","id":425},{"type":"charslot","id":426},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2277_1#1$1","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"海嗣！所有人，警戒！","id":428,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":429},{"type":"charslot","id":430},{"type":"charslot","slot":"R","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","id":431},{"type":"charslot","slot":"L","name":"avg_npc_1389_1#1$1","id":432},{"type":"charslot","slot":"R","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","action":"jump","posto":"-250,0","power":"0","times":"0.8","duration":"0.1","id":433},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"20","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":434},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":435},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":436},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_imp_sword_n","volume":"1","id":437},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":438},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":439},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"3","ystrength":"3","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":440},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_seabornf_pain","volume":"1","id":441},{"type":"charslot","slot":"L","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-100,20","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.7","id":442},{"type":"charslot","slot":"R","posfrom":"-250,0","posto":"-180,0","power":"0","times":"0.8","duration":"0.5","id":443},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"shake","power":"5","times":"60","isblock":"true","duration":"0.2","id":444},{"type":"charslot","slot":"L","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.7","id":445},{"type":"dialog","id":446},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":447},{"type":"charslot","slot":"R","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"惩戒军，不要东张西望，优先清除海嗣威胁！","id":449},{"type":"charslot","slot":"R","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"奥卢斯不在，参与袭击的岛民数量跟我们预测的不同……不对，他们去哪里了？","id":451},{"type":"dialog","id":452},{"type":"charslot","id":453},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_broadcast_third","volume":"1","id":454},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":455},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_broadcast_male","volume":"0","channel":"f","loop":"true","id":456},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.8","channel":"f","fadetime":"0.5","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"惩戒军，审判官，所有伊比利亚人，听好了——","id":458},{"type":"dialog","id":459},{"type":"backgroundtween","yFrom":"0","yTo":"-50","duration":"8","ease":"OutQuad","block":"false","id":460},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_bg_74_g4_seasidest_n.png","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","y":"50","fadetime":"3","block":"false","id":461},{"type":"backgroundtween","yFrom":"50","yTo":"-40","duration":"8","ease":"OutQuad","block":"false","id":462},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":463},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岛民","text":"惩戒军，审判官，所有伊比利亚人，听好了——","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岛民","text":"港都中心城区已经驶离了打捞区，现在正在向远海行进。","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岛民","text":"港都的坐标——它的识别身份——都已经被彻底抹除，不论在伊比利亚还是阿戈尔的海图上，都不复存在。","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岛民","text":"所有灯塔的定位和导航功能也都已经瘫痪，你们甚至不用去尝试修复。灯塔上用的每一种技术，都是我们的——岛民的。","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岛民","text":"你们傲慢地以为那场袭击只是为了破坏港都，但港都从来不仅仅属于你们。伊比利亚，从来不仅仅属于你们。","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岛民","text":"承认所有岛民的正当国民身份，公开过去几十年间与岛民相关的全部案卷，为其中所有的冤假错案正式道歉。","id":469},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岛民","text":"做到这些，我们再谈港都何去何从。","id":470},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":471},{"type":"dialog","id":472},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":473},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":474},{"type":"charslot","id":475},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":476},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":477},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_sea_bg","layer":"1","id":478},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":479},{"type":"sticker","id":480,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n玻璃幕墙之外，是浑浊、黑暗的海水。","x":"240","y":"150","alignment":"left","delay":"0.04","width":"700","isblock":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":481,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n那里本该有一座缀满旗帜的旗语塔。在这座万帆来朝之都，所有商人与使节唯一共通的语言，就是它打出的旗语。","x":"240","y":"260","delay":"0.04","alignment":"left","width":"700","isblock":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":482,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n但现在，它消失得无影无踪。","x":"240","y":"370","alignment":"left","delay":"0.04","width":"700","isblock":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":483,"duration":"2","block":"false"},{"type":"sticker","id":484,"duration":"2","block":"false"},{"type":"sticker","id":485,"duration":"2","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":486},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":487},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":488},{"type":"bgeffect","id":489},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":490},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_bg_74_g13_underseahall_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","id":491},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":492},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","id":493},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"如果你执意要把这件事当作你对我的偿还，那你还清了，瓦列里奥。","id":494,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","id":495},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"多亏你抹去了港都的坐标，遮住了审判庭的眼睛……","id":496,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","id":497},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"它才好延续那耽搁了六十多年的行程。","id":498,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#7$1","id":499},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"真是好久不见了啊，雷亚-伊比利亚。","id":500,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":501},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":502},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":503},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":504},{"type":"charslot","id":505},{"type":"background","id":506},{"type":"image","id":507}],"characters":["紧张的岛民","虚弱的岛民","惩戒军士兵","惩戒军士官","特菲","瓦列里奥","斐戴拉","城镇居民B","城镇居民A","艾丽妮","？？？","岛民","奥卢斯"]}